  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1608.03 Expiration of Site Permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1608.03 Expiration of Site Permit. A site permit and any associated waivers issued by the department shall expire 10 years from the date on which the permit was issued.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
